      "title": "Who is the speaking 'I'?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_2",
          "text": "The identity and temporal standpoint of Romans 7's first-person speaker remain unresolved. Autobiographical, Adamic, Israelite, rhetorical, pre-Messianic, Christian, and composite readings compete. The chapter should therefore not be presented as though one speaker-identification settles the passage's meaning.",
